---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="你访问的页面不存在或已经移动。" noindex={true}>
	<section class="not-found shell">
		<p class="error-number">404</p>
		<div><p class="eyebrow">PAGE NOT FOUND</p><h1>这一页，暂时空白。</h1><p>链接可能已经改变，也可能从未存在。你可以回到首页，或从文章归档重新开始。</p><div class="not-found-links"><a class="text-link" href="/">返回首页</a><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">浏览文章</a><a class="text-link" href="/search/">全文搜索</a></div></div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
	.not-found { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(200px, .8fr) 1fr; align-items: center; gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem); min-height: 65vh; padding-top: 4rem; }
	.error-number { color: var(--line); font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(8rem, 20vw, 17rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.08em; }
	h1 { margin-top: .8rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.8rem); }
	.not-found div > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 460px; margin-top: 1.3rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.9; }
	.not-found-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
	@media (max-width: 600px) { .not-found { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; align-content: center; } .error-number { font-size: 8rem; } }
</style>
